      "role": "assistant",
      "kind": "message",
      "run_id": "34b611ac-8221-48a6-8d90-a45099b47007",
      "text": "收到，扫地机器人显示报错 004。\n\n检索片段中未包含“报错 004”的专属定义，我将按标准排障流程处理。请先尝试**取出尘盒重新安装，确认听到咔哒声**，看报错是否消除。"
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "d0c47316ed2a53cb8ef430699e334bdf",
      "first_seq": 44,
      "role": "assistant",
      "kind": "card",
      "run_id": "34b611ac-8221-48a6-8d90-a45099b47007",
      "text": "按下尘盒释放键抽出尘盒，倒空并检查进风口是否被堵塞。\n{\"seq\": 44, \"step\": {\"title\": \"倒空尘盒并检查进风口\", \"caution\": null, \"plan_id\": \"rv_suction_dustbin_full\", \"step_id\": \"s1\", \"step_no\": 1, \"instruction\": \"按下尘盒释放键抽出尘盒，倒空并检查进风口是否被堵塞。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"df4f9572-9f1a-4762-a135-e38216c79982\"], \"plan_version\": 1, \"expected_result\": \"尘盒清空，进风口无堵塞\"}, \"type\": \"step_card\", \"run_id\": \"4b000dc8bebe4e45ae2010a3cb65a9d4\", \"card_id\": \"d0c47316ed2a53cb8ef430699e334bdf\", \"version\": 2, \"event_id\": \"5eeea60826e65bffa5df8235a69ea9fb\", \"issue_id\": \"ad9ecf3fec8353b6a3d95d5fed79c1e2\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-09-13T09:20:35.192711+00:00\"}"
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "1e130dea-57e3-4623-b40f-3f7f415df978",
      "first_seq": 48,
      "role": "user",
      "kind": "message",
      "run_id": "1e130dea-57e3-4623-b40f-3f7f415df978",
      "text": "你能解决吗"
